      "pos": "noun",
      "lesson": "u03-l06",
      "notes": "Respectful address for a woman somewhat older than you — teachers, colleagues, shop customers. A little more formal than আপু."
    },
    {
      "id": "angkel",
      "bn": "আংকেল",
